# Wheel of Heaven Redirects
# Handles legacy URL structure migration
#
# Rule ordering note: Cloudflare Pages appears to process this file
# with a practical cap somewhere around 270 rules. Rules near the end
# of the file (e.g. the /medium/, /categories/ catch-alls) silently
# 404 in production despite being well under the documented 2,100
# static / 100 dynamic limits. Keep recently-added high-priority
# fixes near the TOP of the file so they're processed before the
# cutoff. Long term, the legacy /intro/* block (~100 rules) should
# probably be condensed.

# Browsers and crawlers also request the conventional root icon directly.
/favicon.ico                        /brand/favicon.ico                   301

# The first pagination page is the Newsroom root; redirect at the HTTP layer.
/news/page/1/                       /news/                               301

# =============================================================================
# 2026-05 — Search Console stale-path 404s (kept near top so they
# don't get clipped by Cloudflare Pages's de-facto rule-count cap)
# =============================================================================

# /wiki/age-of-<zodiac>/ → /timeline/age-of-<zodiac>/  (zodiacs moved
# from /wiki/ to /timeline/; Google still has the old paths cached)
/wiki/age-of-aquarius/               /timeline/age-of-aquarius/           301
/de/wiki/age-of-pisces/              /de/timeline/age-of-pisces/          301
/es/wiki/age-of-gemini/              /es/timeline/age-of-gemini/          301

# /wiki/timeline/<...>/ → /timeline/<...>/  (wiki/timeline nested section
# never existed). Splats cover EN + all locales and preserve the age slug
# via :splat. zh-Hant lacks an age-of-cancer translation, so keep that
# exception FIRST so it lands on the locale timeline index, not a 404.
/zh-Hant/wiki/timeline/age-of-cancer/  /zh-Hant/timeline/                 301
/wiki/timeline/*                     /timeline/:splat                     301
/:lang/wiki/timeline/*               /:lang/timeline/:splat               301

